<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 13.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 13.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 13	     March 12</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.894		  5.285</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   8.323		  8.044</p>
<p>Cash balance		  13.217		 13.229</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,274.513	     5,274.317</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $2 million were issued and $38 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
